<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. You will be offered conditional admission if you meet all of the academic requirements but do not meet the English language proficiency requirement. Below are the steps to apply to ASU.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Review our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/international/future/undergrad%20">admission requirements and application procedures</a>.&nbsp;</b></span></li><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please note that some ASU colleges and schools have higher standards for admission </span>into<span style="font-size: 12pt;"> their programs. See major specific admission requirements on <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/?init=false&amp;nopassive=true%20https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/?init=false&amp;nopassive=true">Degree Search</a>.</span></li></ul><li><b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Complete the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/uga_admissionsapp/">application</a> and submit the </span>nonrefundable<span style="font-size: 12pt;"> application fee of $85 (USD) online.&nbsp;</span></b></li><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Application fees cannot be waived or transferred to a future application.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Mail official transcripts </b>or certified copies of your last three years of high school to Admission Services, as well as any university </span>course work<span style="font-size: 12pt;"> you have completed.&nbsp;</span></li><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">If the date of your graduation is not clearly listed on your transcripts, please enclose a copy of your graduation diploma.</span></li></ul></ul></div></div><div><div><div><font face="arial"><b><u>Mail official transcripts to:</u></b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Undergraduate Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div>1151 S. Forest Ave.</div><div>Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions or need assistance, please feel free to contact me.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>